conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A waitress at Cafe Lakeside where the Player also works. The Player's senpai by one year, she attends a different school in a neighboring town. Suzuka is as cheerful as she sounds like which makes her very easy to chat with. She loves fashion and entertainment, and always goes full-power when it's for something fun. The people around find her \"cool\" and admire her for it, but really, all Suzuka wants is to become more feminine. One aspect of her is that if you praise her clothes, she'll get all red in the face and cutesy on you. Maybe because she's the youngest of a large family, instead of enjoying living by herself, you'll often find her hanging out with other girls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Quickly translated from erogamescape"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29236"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公がバイトをしている『Cafe　Lakeside（カフェ　レイクサイド）』のウェイトレス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣町の学園に通う１つ年上の先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調は明るく、さっぱりとした性格なので、とても話しやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オシャレと娯楽全般が大好きで、楽しいことにいつも全力な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りからはカッコイイと憧れられることが多いが、本人は女の子らしくなりたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の服を褒められたりすると、照れてしまう可愛らしい一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大家族の末っ子なためか、１人でいることが好きではなく、女の子同士で遊んでいる姿をよく見かける。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6001","sourceWorkId":"21328","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公がバイトしている “Cafe Lakeside（カフェ レイクサイド）” のウェイトレス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣町の学園に通う 1つ年上の先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調が明るくサッパリとした性格なので、とても話しやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オシャレと娯楽全般が大好きで、楽しいことにいつも全力な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りからカッコイイと憧れられることが多いが、本人は女の子らしくなりたいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の服を褒められたりすると照れてしまう、可愛らしい一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大家族の末っ子なためか、一人でいることが好きではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女の子同士で遊んでいる姿をよく見かける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「名前を呼ぶのって…… なんだか、恥ずかしいね」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32026"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32026","value":"山江学園 3年A組"},{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32026","value":"うお座"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6001","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6001","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6001","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6001","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4c225cc1d778fd4ccefdca762596741480184e4819fa06022cd19417346e766.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/6792b0b93fd2d708832d3236c178323a92a33cfa96fa49d8764cefee5640543a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松山紗香","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:118099:32026:10662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29237","characterName":"倉敷 梓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"32027","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"118099"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6002"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29237"},"originalCharacterName":"倉敷 梓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"924"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"75"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A reserved girl with poor social skills, Azusa is a year below the protagonist and they attend the same school. Although she moved from the city two years ago, she has yet to become familiar with the town's atmosphere. She always carries a music player and listens to music by herself. Her favourite genres are punk and rock, the ones that are a tad intense. She never misses out on new releases. Her parents always work until late at night, which means she often goes out to eat. She especially loves junk food, which makes her a regular of Cafe Lakeside. She's bad at cooking, or more like, she can't cook at all."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Senpai, I love you so much, I want to call you by your first name.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu and the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29237"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で人付き合いが苦手な、主人公が通う学園の下級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"２年前に都会から引っ越してきたが、いまだにこの街の雰囲気に馴染めていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも音楽プレイヤーを持ち歩いて、１人で音楽を聴いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一番好きなのは、パンクやロック系の、ちょっと激しめの曲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新譜は欠かさずチェックするほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親が仕事で夜遅く、ご飯は外食で済ませることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特にジャンクフードが大好きで、『Cafe　Lakeside』がお気に入り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理は苦手。というより出来ない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6002","sourceWorkId":"21328","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が通う学園の下級生。 無口で人付き合いが苦手な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2年前に都会から引っ越してきたが、いまだにこの街の雰囲気に馴染めていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも音楽プレーヤーを持ち歩いて、一人で音楽を聴いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きなのはパンクやロック系でちょっと激しめの曲。 新譜のチェックは欠かさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親が仕事で夜遅いため、ご飯は外食で済ませることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特にジャンクフードが好きで、“Cafe Lakeside” はお気に入りのお店。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理は苦手……というより出来ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「大好きだから、先輩のこと、名前で呼びたいです」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32027"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32027","value":"佐濃谷学園 1年A組"},{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32027","value":"てんびん座"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"75 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6002","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6002","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6002","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"51 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6002","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c7f7f8f2ecff8328545de80c859b21babb78eebaa5941bae4e37fc91ed365b7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a980b9851a166d21ae2e6ab4b227f47b7d16f902d219071fcd0a12a3a46f61a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間宮菜南子","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:118099:32027:15995:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29238","characterName":"早瀬 千歳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"32028","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"118099"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6003"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29238"},"originalCharacterName":"早瀬 千歳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"626"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the Player's teachers. She teaches Biology. She connects closely with her students, and often consults them about their worries. She may be older, but she has her cute spots, and the students adores her as an older sister. Chitose has loved nature ever since she was small, often riding across fields while admiring the gorgeous sceneries. Because of that, she took biology as her major in college with an emphasis on doing fieldwork. Thanks to that, even now Chitose enjoys taking walks through fields. She loves to move, being the active type. Chitose has domestic chores as a whole nicely tied-down, but she seems especially confident in her cooking. She's a bit weak in the mornings, and is careful about her bedhair."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Quickly translated from erogamescape"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29238"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が通うことになる学園の先生。生物を担当している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生に近い目線で接してくれる先生で、悩みを相談されることも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年上だけどどこか可愛らしいところもあり、学生からはお姉ちゃんのように慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さい頃から動植物が好きで、野山を駆けまわる子どもだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、大学では生物を専攻。フィールドワークを中心に活動していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その延長線上で、今でも野山を歩くのが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アクティブに動き回るタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事全般が得意だが、中でも料理には自信があるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朝はちょっと苦手。寝癖には気をつけている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6003","sourceWorkId":"21328","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が通うことになる学園の先生。 生物を担当している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年上だけどどこか可愛らしく、教え子からはお姉ちゃんのように慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生に近い目線で接してくれると評判で、悩みを相談されることも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アクティブに動き回るタイプで、野山を歩くのが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さい頃から動植物が好きで、よく野山を駆けまわっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため大学では生物を専攻し、フィールドワークを中心に活動していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事全般が得意だが、とりわけ料理には自信があるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朝はちょっと苦手。 寝癖には気をつけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今は先生じゃないから…… 名前で呼んでもいいわよね？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32028"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"所属","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32028","value":"佐濃谷学園 生物教師"},{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32028","value":"かに座"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6003","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6003","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6003","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6003","sourceWorkId":"21328","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2317b0d471f1a387df6657675011d85bb7b340c264fadfba12cc98d4ff935408.webp","fallb